# Portfolio Website 

Welcome to the official repository of my personal portfolio website! This project is built to showcase my background, technical expertise, education, and projects as a **Data Analyst & Machine Learning Practitioner**[cite: 2].

## Live Demo
Check out the live portfolio: [Portfolio Link](https://amandip08.github.io/Portfolio) *(Update this link if you use GitHub Pages)*

##  Built With & Technologies
The portfolio is designed with a clean, responsive layout using modern frontend technologies:
* **HTML5** & **CSS3** (with custom styling and semantic structure)
* **JavaScript** (for navigation, smooth scrolling, and page interactions)
* **Google Fonts (Inter)** for modern typography

## Key Sections Included
* **Hero Section:** Introduction featuring professional titles (Data Analyst & Machine Learning Practitioner) with a direct resume download option[cite: 2].
* **Projects Showcase:** Highlighted work featuring:
  * **Customer Churn Prediction** (Python, Scikit-learn, Pandas, Seaborn)[cite: 2]
  * **Sales Performance Dashboard** (Power BI, DAX, SQL)[cite: 2]
  * **Financial Modeling in Excel** (Excel, VBA, Power Query)[cite: 2]
* **Technical Expertise:** Breakdown of skills across Programming Languages (Python, SQL), Analytics & BI Tools (Power BI, Excel, DAX), and Machine Learning Libraries (Scikit-learn, NumPy)[cite: 2].
* **Education Journey:** Academic background including BCA and M.Sc. Information Technology from GGDSD College, Chandigarh[cite: 2].
* **Contact & Socials:** Direct links to connect via Email, LinkedIn, and GitHub[cite: 2].

